    "Only a small one-item legacy CopyQ v2 text fixture imported, BEFORE/AFTER replaced, ASCII line appended and a second ASCII item added. Explicit-menu copy checked with actual Clipboard Content text/plain17bytes, only-fixture CopyQ v4 export and explicit new-process GUI import verified. Synthetic CPQ files do not count as apps.",
